@startuml seq-provider-down
!theme plain
title Sequence - Provider down / degraded read (last-known-good)

actor Client
participant "GraphQL\nAPI" as GQL
participant "Store" as Store
participant "Open-Meteo\nclient" as OMClient
database "Postgres" as PG

Client -> GQL : query activityRanking(...)
GQL -> Store : getForecastDays
Store -> PG : SELECT
PG --> Store : rows exist, last_fetched_at old
Store --> GQL : features + age

alt warm path (data present)
  GQL --> Client : rankings, stale=true,\ndataAgeSeconds exceeds threshold\n(no Open-Meteo call)
else cold-start AND circuit open / timeout
  GQL -> OMClient : fetchForecast
  OMClient --> GQL : fail (circuit open)
  GQL --> Client : GraphQL error\n(no data to serve)
end

note over GQL, PG
  Availability of **our** API must not
  depend on Open-Meteo when we already
  have persisted forecasts.
end note

@enduml
